    <h1><%= title %></h1>
    <p>Hi my name is Clark Snider. I am a second-year Networking and IT student at Ontario Tech. I like playing video games, music and skating. My favourite games right now are Magic the Gathering, Risk of Rain 2, and Fear and Hunger 2 Termina. A game I really want to start is Chrono Trigger. My favourite bands are MCR, Cage the Elephant, Paramore, and Alexisonfire.  <!--but recently I've been really enjoying this small band called jayniac Jr--> My favourite shows are Futurama, Community and It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia. I am currently learning Spanish Romance and Hurt by Johnny Cash on the guitar. The coding languages I know are python, java and javascript. I have an interest in modding and jailbreaking old devices.</p>
